explanation:
Run this complete example in a fresh database.
```sql
CREATE TABLE readings(id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,value INTEGER);
INSERT INTO readings VALUES(1,'12'),(2,'twelve');
CREATE TEMP VIEW shown AS
SELECT id,value,typeof(value) AS kind
FROM readings;
SELECT *
FROM shown
ORDER BY id;
```

Change the supplied values and trace the result. This is a separate complete example.
```sql
CREATE TABLE readings(id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,value TEXT);
INSERT INTO readings VALUES(1,12),(2,NULL);
CREATE TEMP VIEW shown AS
SELECT id,value,typeof(value) AS kind
FROM readings;
SELECT *
FROM shown
ORDER BY id;
```

